window.products.push({"id":1004064,"name":"4-Blade Wood Stove Fan Heat Powered Stove Fan Heat-Resistant Anodized Aluminum Material Stove Fan for Wood Stove/Pellet Stove/Log Burner Fireplace Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qNaqY7TCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Heat-Resistant Anodized Aluminum Material: The wood stove fan base and blade are made from anodized aluminum, which make the stove fan not rust or corrode, it is durable enough for a long time use. No deformation and no discoloration even after long time working under high temperature. No Batteries Eco-friendly: wood stove fan generate power by converting the heat from stove into electricity, electricity generating units convert the heat energy into kinetic energy to drive the motor, then the blades spin.No batteries or electricity required, eco-friendly. Easy To Use: You simply place the wood stove fan on the smooth surface of the stove top, and as the temperature rises, the wood stove fan circulates more warm air. The stove fan is also a great heartwarming gift that you can give friends and family. Silent Operation: Newly Designed Blade, Larger Air Volume,Lower noise. You don't even know the wood stove fan is there,but you feel the warmth! You will enjoy the warm air in a quiet and comfortable environment. Safety Guarantee: The wood stove fan working with a temperature between 80°C(176℉) to 250°C(482℉) centigrade degree, There is overheating protection metal on the bottom of the stove fan, if the wood stove fan gets too hot, the metal will gently lift the front of the woodstove fan to protect the TEG and motor. we offer up to 12 months warranty. If you have any questions, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qNaqY7TCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KTEJIIJ","source_asin":"B09LH6V15C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LH6V15C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LH6V15C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
