window.products.push({"id":1004108,"name":"SAMSONITE, Premium Plush Lumbar Support Pillow for Chair - Elevates Lower Back Comfort Zone - 100% Pure Memory Foam - Perfect for Car or Office - Fits","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lpnte89RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Samsonite’s memory foam lumbar support cushion won’t forget you. The high-grade memory foam inside the cushion reacts in real time to align to, and offer strong support and strain relief along, the precise curvatures of your lower back. The more you use the cushion, the better its memory functions will work, so as you use this pillow more often, it will serve you better and better. Adding to the memory foam’s strength is an outer plush layer that lets you sink right into this cushion, even as the foam is offering its firmest support. The foam and plush make a formidable team that works tirelessly to keep your lower back well supported over long rides, short trips across town, or stuck stationary and tense in bumper-to-bumper traffic. This cushion is contoured for comfort with a curve that follows the natural arch of the lower back. Many lumbar support cushions are merely flat rectangles, but this shape doesn’t account for the lower back’s curvature. In properly accounting for this arch, Samsonite’s lumbar support cushion offers the sort of strain relief that back pain sufferers absolutely dream of. Keeping this lumbar support cushion sturdy and functioning throughout its usage is an adjustable strap that wraps tightly around any standard car seat. Once you set the seat right where you want it, all you need to do is snap the strap into place. Even rocky roads can’t rattle the cushion out of place once you’ve properly strapped this cushion in place. The Memory Foam Lumbar Support Cushion pillow’s plush is housed in a removable layer that you can toss in the washer the next time laundry day arrives. After a standard washer and dryer cycle, you can return the outer layer to the inner foam to make your cushion appear and feel as good as new. Doing so is a simple workaround for cleaning the cushion without exposing it to water damage, which can degrade the memory foam that makes this cushion so unparalleled. ● Dimensions: 13. 5” x 14” x 4. 5”● High-grade memory foam for optimized, unending lumbar support● Plush covering enhances lower back comfort ● Contoured shape accounts for natural arch of lumbar region● Adjustable strap for secure, sturdy use and easy switching between seats● Removable cover for careful, damage-free cleaning","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lpnte89RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samsonite","source_asin":"B07MHJSXJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MHJSXJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MHJSXJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
