window.products.push({"id":1004225,"name":"Brainstream Cregg 3-in-1 Topper, Cup and Napkin Ring The Gentle Way to Open Eggs, Lime","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MV02reRLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cream is a brilliantly innovative device from Brainstream. This 3-in-1 gadget's main function is an egg topper that makes removing the shell from a boiled egg easy. A stainless steel ring functions like a glass cutter to cut through the shell with ease. Simply place the cutter wheels, which are not sharp enough to hurt you, faced down atop the egg and twist with a simple back and forth motion. This will cut the shell, which can then easily be removed with a spoon or knife. After the eggshell is removed, Use the cream as a stand to hold up your egg! Alternatively, the cream can be used as a simple and safe napkin holder before any meal. Made entirely in Germany, the cream is available in a variety of different colors. Wash by hand for best care. The roots of Brainstream can be traced back to 2000 when German Engineer and Entrepreneur rupprecht Gabriel became fed up with his poorly boiled breakfast eggs. Sometimes his eggs came out too hard while other times they were much too runny for his likely. In hopes of sparing himself this frustration, he sought to invent a Product that did the work for him-resulting in brainstream's first Product: The beepegg. After it's great success, Gabriel then formed a creative team to create a small, but strong assortment of products that fit the claim \"fun and functional. \" today, Their little everyday aids are available in more than ten countries worldwide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MV02reRLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brainstream","source_asin":"B007T7XY96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007T7XY96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007T7XY96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
