window.products.push({"id":1004366,"name":"Steamer for Clothes Steamer, 25s Heat Up Handheld Clothing Steamer 1500W Hand Held Portable Travel Garment Steamer Clothing Mini Steamer Steam for Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZuAKZX89L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features:- Powerful 1500 watts heating system heats up incredibly fast in 25 seconds.Remove all wrinkles from your garments easily. - Small size can be easily collected into the luggage, so it will save more space than other steamer, perfect for traveling. - Coming with 4 removable attachment, fabric brush, creaser, soft cushion brush and heating plate, provide you a wonderful steaming experience. - Perfect for most types of fabrics, cotton, wool, polyester, plush, fiber, nylon, plush, polyester, linen and more.- The indicator light turns up orange after powered on. Waiting for 25 seconds until indicator turns off, it shows heating ready. Then press the button to steam your clothes. Specifications: Rated Voltage: AC110 to 120V Rated Frequency: 50/60 Hz Rated Power: 1500W Shell material: PC Plastic Power Cord: 6.56ft/ 2m Capacity of water tank: 75ml Heating time: 25 seconds Working time: 8 to 10 minsProduct Size: 31.4X15.1X10.7 cmProduct Weight: 2.47lb/1.12kg Package Include: 1 x Garment Steamer 1 x Travel Bag 1 x Measuring Cup 4 x Removable Attachments (fabric brush, creaser, soft cushion brush and heating plate)Tips:1. Allow steamer to cool completely before cleaning or storing. Keep out of children. 2. To avoid electric shock do not immerse the steamer or power cord in water or any other liquid. 3. When operating the garment steamer for the first time, allow it to steam for a few minutes. this will remove any impurities and odours that might have been left by the manufacturing process.4. There may be water drops which was injected in the product for testing has remained on the delivered product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZuAKZX89L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greensen","source_asin":"B083733669","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083733669","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083733669","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
