window.products.push({"id":1004577,"name":"Swiss Comforts Duvet Insert White Microfiber Carbon Bed Comforter - Queen Size | Lightweight & Soft | Down Alternative Quilted & Hypoallergenic, All S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g07jM0GxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Carbon Comforter: What is this made of: The Carbon comforter is an anti-stress super comforter with anti-static properties made from micro carbon fabric. The carbon strings, which are woven into the casing fabric, disperse the static energy that has accumulated throughout the day. It has hand stitched double stitching and piping. The carbon duvet can be used with a duvet cover to reduce the anti-stress effects. Use and purpose: The purpose of our Carbon comforter is to be used as a Duvet insert. Available in: Twin, Queen and King Features: Swiss Comforts DESIGN AND MATERIALS. The Swiss Comforts Down Alternative Carbon Comforter is made of high quality soft micro carbon fiber, which provides a smooth surface that keeps the body comfortable, as well as hand-crafted double stitching and piping all around for item longevity. The box quilt stitch pattern holds the filling in place to ensure even distribution. The filling is hypoallergenic and made of 3D 280 GSM down alternative. Product Details: > Material: microfiber/carbon fiber > Breathable fabric > Box quilt stitch design keeps the filling in place for even distribution Care instructions: - Machine washable - Tumble dry on low setting - Do not bleach Size & Dimensions > Dimensions (L x W): > Queen: 90 inches × 90 inches > King: 90 inches × 104 inches What makes this product the best in the market in comparison to other competition ? The warm lightweight feel of the down alternative comforter makes it the best in the market; it is used all year. Keep your body cool and fresh in the summer and cozy and warm in the winter. It is also machine washable, which adds to the comforter's appeal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g07jM0GxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swiss Comforts","source_asin":"B09Q977V6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q977V6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q977V6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
