window.products.push({"id":1004750,"name":"Mesha 500pcs Assorted Color Party Balloons Supplies,12 Inches 8 Kinds of Rainbow Latex Balloon, Various Globos for Garland Arch Kit Decoration, Bridal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GVLyJDj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MESHA Assorted Colors Party Balloons Mesha balloons are beautiful and fun addition to any party. No party would seem complete without balloons to play around with. Balloons are not just for parties, they can be used anywhere anytime and for any occasion you wish to celebrate. Whether it is a party in the office, a Christmas bash, a baby shower, wedding, or a casual party for friends, balloons seem to be an essential of party supplies. Along with buntings, balloons are the most favored decorations for any occasion. With Mesha party balloons, you can be sure that your party will always be colorful and fun. Eco-Friendly free allergy Balloons Mesha 12” birthday balloons are made with quality latex which is a form of rubber. It is biodegradable and eco-friendly unlike the other balloons. They are available in a rainbow hue of colors. Check the listing for colors before you order. Mesha balloons are safe to be filled with air, water or helium gas. Safety Instructions and Usage: Mesha Balloons are made with rubber so they are inflammable. Do not bring them near fire. Balloons should not be ingested as they are dangerous to health. Children should be monitored while playing with balloons.  Do not fill balloons with cheaper gas like hydrogen which can ignite and cause a fire hazard. Use only an inert gas like Helium to fill the balloon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GVLyJDj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MESHA","source_asin":"B07C1N5GVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C1N5GVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C1N5GVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
