window.products.push({"id":1004776,"name":"Manual Thomas Kinkade Wall Hanging, Country Living, 36 X 26-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eGkjN-+ML._AC_.jpg","description":"Featuring the art of world famous artist Thomas Kinkaid and woven in the USA. Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers & Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eGkjN-+ML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thomas Kinkade","source_asin":"B0032N9KQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0032N9KQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0032N9KQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1004777,"name":"AIKASY Boho Bed in a Bag 7 Pieces Queen Size, Black/White Tufted Comforter Set, Mid Century Trendy Geometric Design,All Season Cozy Cover with Sheets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ldJFcemEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Tufted Design】: AIKASY boho comforter set with a classic tufted design, solid color with delicate geometric patterns. Classy tufted embroidery pattern brings a unique and luxurious look to any bedroom, simple yet sophisticated design to refresh your bedroom. 【Soft & Comfortable】:The Microfiber Comforter Features Geometric Pattern Stripes, in subtle hues, with eyelash-looking woven details that add a charming accent to the top of the bed. Hidden bartacks create a clean, duvet-like finish. 【Thoughtful Details】:The elegant yet durable Diamond Tufted shell utilizes a box stitch design to avoid shifting of the 100% polyester filling. This comforter is machine washable and only gets softer with every wash. 【Ideal Gift Choice】:The 7 pieces Queen bedding comforter set come well packaged. It includes 1 Queen comforter 90\"x90\", 2 pillow shams 20\"x26\", 1 Queen Fitted Sheet 60\" W x 80\" L + 12\", 1 Queen Flat Sheet 90\" W x 102\" L, 2 Standard Pillowcases 20\" W x 30\", The fitted sheet is 12 inch Pocket. Fits mattresses up to 12\". 【Easy Care】:The delicate stitching ensures durability, high-density fabric guarantees that it will not rip or shrink easily. Machine washable in cold water. Gentle cycle, and tumble dry at low temperature. Please do not bleach. Warm Tips:Since the bag is vacuum sealed, we strongly recommend that you wash and iron it at a low temperature and let it sit for a while or pat it gently to bring it back to its original fluffy, soft and comfortable state.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ldJFcemEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIKASY","source_asin":"B0B351Y2QH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B351Y2QH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B351Y2QH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
