window.products.push({"id":1004807,"name":"EZ-Inject Plastic Syringes for Jello Shots 2.5oz - 100% Safe and Reusable Jello Shot Syringes with Caps - 25 Pack Large Syringe Shots Holiday and Hall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913szaAY1hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MUST-HAVE FOR ANY PARTY - Our party jello shot syringes are perfect for adult Halloween party, thanksgiving, Christmas, new year, bachelorette party, concert, graduation party, birthday party, drinking get-together, drinking game or any other event. They are a hit at any nightclub, bar, home party, and tailgate. NO LEAKS & MESSY DRIPS - EZ-inject 2.5oz large syringes for liquid and jello shots come with leak-free plastic caps to keep your tasty jello shot mixes intact inside the barrel and your party venue mess-free. A wide mouth tip allows you to squirt jello shot right into your mouth without creating any mess. FOR JELLO SHOTS AND OTHER SHOOTERS - EZ-Inject Halloween shot syringes are designed especially for jello shots, but they can also be used for shooters, drinks, beverages, and other liquids. Comes in 25 pack bundle to meet your party needs. EASY TO FILL & DISPENSE - The plastic jello shot syringe has a wide opening tip for easy fill. Dip it into the jello shot mixture, pull back the plunger, let it cool down for some time, and squirt it into your mouth when you’re ready to take the shot. REUSABLE AND EASY TO CLEAN - Made of premium food grade BPA-free plastic, EZ-inject Halloween drinkware jello shot containers syringes are 100% reusable, easy to clean, and dishwasher-safe. After use, clean and store them in a plastic container or ziplock bag so you can use them again at your next party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913szaAY1hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZ-Inject","source_asin":"B004QI169Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004QI169Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004QI169Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1004808,"name":"BB Candles Mermaid Shore Artisan Hand Poured Candle, Natural Soy Wax Candle, Fragrant Coastal Candle with Strong Scents, 8oz, 50+ Hours Burn Time (Tur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lG0I66YNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BB Candles specializes in hand-poured candle-making using beautiful vessels that can easily be repurposed for a lifetime of enjoyment. Our candles are made in the U.S with ingredients from all over the world. We are inspired by a world in which beauty, nature, and sustainability find a place in each home.   Our Mermaid Shore Collection reflects our passion for coastal living and design. Inspired by the waters of Turquoise Bay, St. Thomas, this beautiful candle takes you straight to paradise! Created with the intention of making your space welcoming and relaxing just like the fond memories of your time on the coast. The Fragrances of this unique collection are inspired by the long summer days and distinct aromas of our most treasured coastal memories. Coastal Scented Candles Long summer days and distinct aromas of our most treasured coastal memories, our beach scented candles are sure to take you to the coast! Natural Soy Candles Our soy wax candles burn without residue and harmful toxins. Phthalates, chemical binders and dye-free.  100% Cotton Eco wicks are tested and carefully selected to enhance fragrance diffusion and burn time.  Natural pure color is preserved to avoid using harmful dyes and additives. 8oz, 50+ Hours Burn Time Hand Poured Coastal Style Candles and Design Hand-poured in small batches on the Golden California Coast.  Hand-applied starfish to each jar. Glass vessel providing warm hues and subtle fragrance. Natural & Sustainable Candles Reusable candle container.  We source biodegradable and eco-friendly ingredients.  Made in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lG0I66YNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BB Candles","source_asin":"B089B7SY4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089B7SY4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089B7SY4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1004809,"name":"Henslow Knife Sharpener Is 4 In 1 Multi-Functional Knife Sharpening System—— 1 Scissor Sharpening System & Professional 3 Stage Sharpening System , 5 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pIkNbECGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Henslow Knife Sharpener is a revolution in the sharpening tools industry . It add a pair of scissors sharpening function .  Professional chefs know that a good knife is the most important tool in any kitchen. But even the best knife is useless if it's not kept sharp.  Use Henslow Knife Sharpener, and your old knife will be as sharp as new.The sharpener saves you money as you will not need to replace those blunt knives.  Sleek and Stare-of-the-art Design: Having an extremely sleek, durable and elegant look, this sharpener could be your premium choice as a practical gift to your friends and family members.  Sleek and Stare-of-the-art Design: Having an extremely sleek, durable and elegant look, this sharpener could be your premium choice as a practical gift to your friends and family members.  Do you want to have a sharp knife? you want to easily cut bone, meat, fruit and so on it? Don't hesitate, quickly click the \"add to cart\" buy Henslow Knife Sharpener !   Using method:  Sharpening Scissors ：Slot 1 dedicated for Scissor sharpening .Pulling in one direction only 4-6 times . In the scissors case, it should always be ''Pushing''.  Sharpening knife：First in the slot 2 pull 3-5 times. this slot will reshape your most damaged blades back to its orginal shape . Then in the slot 3 pull 3-5 times , further sharpen sharpen your knife . At the end of the slot 4 pull 2-3 times , Slot 4 Dedicated for knives and blades that needs polishing . please note that for any type of sharpening,always sharpening in one direction . In the knife case, it shoud always be\"Pulling\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pIkNbECGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Henslow","source_asin":"B01E1ZVHBA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E1ZVHBA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E1ZVHBA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
