window.products.push({"id":1004816,"name":"Kardiel Stuart Mid-Century Modern Lounge Chair & Ottoman, Heather Cashmere Wool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IBI4xaUEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Classic mid-century styling, modern good looks and rich comfort are the elements designed into the Stuart Lounge Chair. So often, mid century modern classics are great for design but not comfortable for everyday use. If you are searching for a classic that is up to the expectations of practical everyday use, Stuart may be the lounge chair for you. A full size frame, swept back pitch and ample cushioning are features of comfort. The matching ottoman is the ideal lounging compliment or use as additional bench seating when entertaining calls. Quality features like multi-density cushions, a reinforced seat platform and a traditional hardwood frame. Stuart will be a comfortable part of your mid century modern collection for years to come. * Style: Stuart Circa '58 Lounge Chair & Ottoman * Frame: Cushion wrapped traditional hardwood body frame * Seat Platform: Reinforced bottom seat cushion platform for firm longer lasting support * Foam Type: Multi-density foam seat and back cushion wrapped in silk layer provide comfort and cushion structure memory * Seat Cushion Style: Removable rear zippered seat cushion * Stitch Edge Type: Low profile hand-stitch & matching seam piping * Tufting Type: True to original button tufting * Fabric Type: Cashmere Tweed Pea-coat * Fabric Content: Cashmere Wool Blend. 50% Cashmere Wool, 50% Synthetic Fiber * Back style: Fitted stationary single piece back * Dimensions: Height 34.6″ x Depth 35″ x Width 35.4″ * Dimension: Floor to seat height 17.7″ * Dimension:: Floor to arm height 20.5″ * Ottoman Dimension: Height 17.7” x Depth 23.3” x 17.75” Width * Leg Height: Front 7.8” tall & back 6.3” tall * Leg Type: American Walnut Hardwood Legs * Feature: The entire chair is stitched and crafted by hand * Feature: Comes standard with floor protection caps on legs About the Tweed Fabric Style Tweed is a flat surfaced wool, originally homespun and slightly felted. This fabric is sturdy and features a smooth overall appearance with a mottled color. About Cashmere Cashmere wool fiber is obtained from “Cashmere goats.” Historically, fine-haired Cashmere goats have been called Capra hircus laniger, as if they were a subspecies of the domestic goat Capra Hircus. Cashmere goats produce a double fleece that consists of a fine, soft undercoat or under-down of hair mingled with a straighter and much coarser outer coating of hair called Guard Hair. For the fine under-down to be sold and processed further, it must be de-haired. De-hairing is a mechanical process that separates the coarse hairs from the fine hair. After this separating process the resulting premium “cashmere” is ready to be dyed and converted into yarn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IBI4xaUEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kardiel","source_asin":"B00N67H110","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N67H110","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N67H110","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1004817,"name":"Lipper International Teak Wood Paddle Board with Beveled Edges and Leather Tie for Charcuterie, Hors D’oeuvres, Cheeses, Meats or Snacks, Small, 16\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eaPJfiwWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For presenting hors d’oeuvres, cheeses, meats or snacks, these Teak Paddle Boards with Leather Ties and Rounded Edges have the style to make an impressive display. You can use one of these teak paddle boards as a serving tray, decorative centerpiece or cutting board. These paddle boards are a must-have for your table whether you are serving up cheese or appetizers at a family dinner, holiday gathering or cocktail party. Teak’s resistance to moisture and abundant natural oils makes it an ideal wood for culinary applications. Durable and beautiful, this teak paddle board will add a beautiful dimension to your serving as well as offer years of use. Hand wash with a mild soap and cool water. Do not soak. Do not put in the dishwasher, microwave or refrigerator. Extreme changes in temperature will cause the material to crack over time. Dry thoroughly. Occasional use of mineral oil on the inside will help maintain its appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eaPJfiwWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lipper International","source_asin":"B0B2PZVGSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2PZVGSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2PZVGSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
