window.products.push({"id":1004865,"name":"Glass Teapot Stovetop Safe - Stainless Steel Infuser - Blooming and Loose Leaf Tea Pot - Large Capacity 1200ml/40oz by Nest Above","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713htQE7fBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stovetop-Safe Glass Tea Kettle with Infuser So Beautiful You’ll Never Want to Put it Away! “I found the perfect one! It is just beautiful…” - Marie V. SAVE TIME - HEAT ON THE STOVE You can safely heat the teapot on any gas or electric stove. The special heat-resistant borosilicate glass allows you to hold the teapot by the handle after heating.“I was concerned about putting the glass teapot onto my gas burners at first since it looks so delicate, however my concerns were unfounded. This thing is quite strong!” - Elizabeth E. NANO PURE INFUSER™ MAKES THE PERFECT TEA EVERY TIME The infuser is designed to reach all the way to the bottom of the pot and not let any tea leaves escape into your tea.“The infuser is very fine so tea doesn't get through which is great...also goes very far down the pot so you don't have to fill the whole thing with water for it to work.” - Customer ENJOY WITH FRIENDS (MAKES 5-6 CUPS) You can make as little as 1-2 cups or you can enjoy tea with a group with the 40 ounce capacity.“I was looking for a glass teapot that the tea strainer went far enough to the bottom that I could pour water into for 1-2 cups of tea. If you look at the other glass teapots on Amazon, the strainers only come to about halfway down...meaning you have to pour in more water so that the tea can seep. I have had this teapot for a few months now...using it everyday...I couldn't be more happier with it!” - N. Raukko THE PERFECT TEAPOT FOR YOU - GUARANTEED FOR 1 YEAR We believe we’ve designed the perfect teapot. And, if anything happens, a drop, crack, or “oopsie”, we’ll replace it for FREE. More you’ll love: Microwave and dishwasher safe Crafted non-drip spout Infuser and lid designed to stay in-place when pouring Easy-to-hold handle Click the Add to Cart button now to get your teapot!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713htQE7fBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEST ABOVE","source_asin":"B01M9C7P0P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M9C7P0P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M9C7P0P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
