window.products.push({"id":1004885,"name":"Purikia Portable Air Conditioner, Personal Space Air Cooler Mini Evaporative Fans Ultra Quiet Humidifier Misting Fan With 3 Speeds and Colourful Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sLVx2waLL._AC_.jpg","description":"What can I do for you? 1.Purikia portable air conditioner uses ultrasonic atomization technology to atomize the water in the water tank into ultra-fine water molecules, and the fan blows out cool and humid air. Unlike other air conditioners, our air cooler can cool the surrounding air without making your skin feel dry.  2.Different from other products on the market, we use unique product materials, which can add ice cubes and essential oils. Add ice cubes to the water tank and add essential oils to the sponge, you will immediately feel the magic of the product, which makes the wind cooler and smells more fragrant.  3.Air Cooler has three adjustable wind speeds (high, medium and low), the maximum fan speed reaches 4500RMP, and the maximum wind speed reaches 3.8m/s. The product can oscillacte 60 degrees or 120 degrees, allow the air-conditioning to blow to more places and expand the personal cooling zone.  Warm Tips : 1. When the water tank is short of water, the light will turn red and flash 3 times. You need to add water to the water tank, and then press the \"Mist\" to enjoy the cool again. 2. It does not use refrigerants or chemicals to cool the air, so it might not have the same effect as a regular air conditioner, but surely a revolutionary fans alternative. 3. This portable air conditioner with a compact size is designed for personal use, the cooling effect may be impacted if placed far away. Product Specifications Model : PA04 Colour : White Weight : 2.77 pounds Dimension : 5.51 x 5.51 x 10.63 inches Power Supply : 100V - 240V Wattage : 8W Oscillate Angle：60/120 degrees","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sLVx2waLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purikia","source_asin":"B09D7GR6LY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1004885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7GR6LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7GR6LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
